    "title": "Is Dunkin' open on Easter? See restaurant chains that are open, closed",
    "text": "Christians in Massachusetts will be celebrating Easter this Sunday, April 5.Easter celebrates the resurrection of Jesus Christ and follows a 40-day period known as Lent. The date the holiday is celebrated changes from year to year because it is one of several \"moveable feasts\" in the liturgical year, according to the History Channel.Some retail and grocery store chains will be closed on April 5 this year in celebration of the holiday, and that is the case for some restaurant chains as well.Here's what you need to know about which restaurants will be open and closed on Easter in 2026.Is McDonald's open on Easter?Hours vary by location but most McDonald's locations in the U.S. are open on holidays, the company told USA TODAY.Customers can use the store locator tool to confirm hours for their local restaurant.Is Starbucks open on Easter?Starbucks store hours vary by location. You can find hours for a specific store using the Starbucks app.Is Dunkin' open on Easter?Dunkin' store hours vary by location, so customers can check the hours for their local Dunkin' using the Dunkin' app or their online store locator.The company told USA TODAY most locations will be open on Easter.Is Chick-fil-A open on Easter?Easter is celebrated on a Sunday, so Chick-fil-A will be closed.Is Chipotle open on Easter?No, Chipotle restaurants will be closed on Easter, the company confirmed to USA TODAY.Is Cava open on Easter?Cava restaurants will be closed on April 5, the company told USA TODAY.Is Wendy's open on Easter?Most Wendy's locations will be open on Easter, the company told USA TODAY, however hours vary by location, so it is best to check with your local restaurant for their specific holiday hours.Is Cracker Barrel open on Easter?Cracker Barrel restaurants will be open their regular hours on Easter – 7 a.m. to 9 p.m. – the company confirmed to USA TODAY.Is Applebee's open on Easter?Select Applebee's restaurants nationwide will be open on Easter, although hours may be reduced, the company told USA TODAY.Applebee's restaurants are independently owned and operated, so hours vary by location. Customers are encouraged to check with their local restaurant regarding specific holiday hours.Is IHOP open on Easter?IHOP restaurants will be open on April 5. Hours vary by location, so check with your local restaurant for their specific hours.Is Subway open on Easter?Subway restaurants are independently owned and operated, so customers should check with their local restaurant regarding specific holiday hours.Is Taco Bell open on Easter?Hours of operation may vary by location, so customers are encouraged to check with their local restaurant regarding their holiday hours.Is Olive Garden open on Easter?Yes, Olive Garden restaurants will be open regular hours on April 5, the company confirmed to USA TODAY.Is Cheesecake Factory open on Easter?Cheesecake Factory restaurants will be open regular hours on Easter, the company told USA TODAY.Is Panera Bread open on Easter?Panera hours vary by location but most restaurants should be open on Easter, the company told USA TODAY. Customers are encouraged to reach out to their local restaurants for specific holiday hours.Gabe Hauari is a national trending news reporter at USA TODAY. You can follow him on X @GabeHauari or email him at Gdhauari@gannett.comThis article originally appeared on Telegram & Gazette: Are fast food chains open Easter? See which are open, closed in MA",
